{"availability":"available","full":"RubenLazell/ff-draft-tool","name":"ff-draft-tool","description":"Build your own fantasy football rankings, refine them head-to-head, print a draft-day cheat sheet, and see any real Sleeper or ESPN league ranked by strength — judged against your rankings, not a generic consensus. Includes a Chrome extension for live draft-day overlays.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-02T19:35:11Z","updated":"2026-10-08T22:06:40Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ff-draft-tool-neon.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://ff-draft-tool-neon.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:06.639Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:06.639Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:06.639Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:06.639Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A fantasy football draft assistant: build your own player rankings, refine them head-to-head, print a draft-day cheat sheet, and see any real Sleeper or ESPN league ranked by strength — judged against your rankings, not a generic consensus. A companion Chrome extension overlays your board live on ESPN and Sleeper draft rooms."],"features":["Rankings board — drag-and-drop your own big board, seeded from consensus ADP across five formats (PPR, Half-PPR, Standard, Superflex, Dynasty). Search, filter by position, jump a player straight to a rank, vs.-ADP…","Head-to-head compare — get dealt two players from your own board (gap size drawn from a binomial distribution, mostly close neighbors, occasionally a wider sanity check) and pick who you'd rather draft; your rankings…","Printable cheat sheet — a clean, position-color-coded, print-ready sheet generated straight from your board.","League import — paste a real Sleeper or ESPN league ID and see every team ranked by strength: each team's optimal starting lineup (respecting the league's actual ros